  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform thin hemispherical shell is kept at rest and in equilibrium on an inclined plane of angle of inclination <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math> as shown in the figure. If the surface of the inclined plane is sufficiently rough to prevent sliding then the angle <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></math>&nbsp;(in degree) made by the plane of hemisphere with inclined plane is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" height=\"138\" src=\"assets\\qt0088_8d016f18d84d.jpg\" width=\"249\" />"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;is the centre of mass of the hollow hemisphere and is at&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"141\" src=\"assets\\st0088_851f987a1015.jpg\" width=\"239\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" height=\"189\" src=\"assets\\st0088_4dd0ceef2760.jpg\" width=\"89\" /><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N=</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow></mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R-</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math>"
